# Hi there, I'm Anderson! 👋

I am a **Senior QA Automation Engineer** and **Full Stack Developer** with nearly 3 years of hands-on experience leading software quality, architecting clean backends, and automating robust testing environments. 

I specialize in bridging the gap between clean code development and bulletproof quality assurance.

