*   **QA & Test Automation:** Web, Mobile, and API Testing | Playwright, Selenium, Puppeteer, Postman, Supertest.
*   **Backend Development:** Node.js (Express, Next.js), JavaScript, PHP (Laravel) | Clean Architecture & Service-Layer Design.
*   **Databases & DevOps:** PostgreSQL, MongoDB | CI/CD Pipelines, Linux Server Management (SSH/Termius), Docker.

